    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d402">

                <pb facs="0603" n="557" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg557"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/18450</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Wilson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 15, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: Here is a draft of the
                    reply to the Mexican note of May 22d.<anchor n="30" xml:id="d402-f1"/> I believe
                    that it embodies the suggestions which you made to me this morning and sets
                    forth clearly the case between us and the <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi>
                    Government.</p>
                <p>I have not shown this draft to General Scott for the purpose of correcting any
                    minor errors of fact in regard to the conferences at El Paso, because I thought
                    it would be unwise to do so until it had received your approval as to substance.
                    It was my idea after you had made such changes as you desire to submit it to him
                    for the purpose of any corrections which might be necessary.</p>
                <p>The note does not include reference to the two raids into American territory made
                    during the past few days, but they can be inserted if so desired.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d402-f1" n="30" xml:id="d402-f1-content">
